{%- doc -%}
  SVG sprite for the Moment marks (placeholders until an illustrator delivers the final set). The grid set (2026-10-30):
  daily = Office (briefcase), night = Evening out (lantern), love = Date night (rose), fresh = Summer heat (palm leaf),
  occasions = Weddings & Eid (crescent and star), winter = Winter nights (steaming cup); gift and allday stay for the Gift block and older content.
  Render it once per page in the layout; snippets/moment-mark.liquid points at the symbols with <use>.

  Layer structure, the contract for the final artwork: every symbol has
    <g class="mm-body">    the main shape (it moves in the gestures of Night and Fresh; Night's moon is nested inside it)
    <g class="mm-accent">  the one small part that moves in the other gestures
    <g class="mm-detail">  extra line work shown only at the large size (120 px and up)
  Standalone files delivered by an illustrator use id="body", id="accent" and id="detail" for the same groups.
  Colors come from the component tokens in assets/moments.css: one plum line weight, a nude body, a berry accent,
  gold at most once per mark.

  @example
  {% render 'moment-marks-sprite' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

<svg width="0" height="0" style="position: absolute" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
